  "correctness": "Every timed core output is checked against the independent reference flow in benches/support/capacity_reference.rs or the atomic-segment oracle in benches/support/profile_reference.rs, with exhaustive checks on ten-row restrictions. Polars outputs are checked against independent clique optima. Objectives match across every revision and run.",
